<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index fell 10 points to 1,264.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index fell 10 points to 1,264.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates fell to 1,264 today from 1,274 on April 25, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1342    12.183	  1340    12.169</p>
<p>   1a   1253  9492.000	  1278  9681.000</p>
